/T (This report reflects the collective work of students, professors, and pedagogical professionals at the Telfer School of Management, united in reimagining the first year of the B.Com. program. Supported by the Dom-Herrick Fund for Experiential Learning and Entrepreneurship and the Green Academy, the workshops provided a space for open dialogue and creative collaboration. We also thank all those who contributed with their administrative support and support. Their names are presented below in alphabetical order by first name. )
